    "created_at": "2016-03-22T06:25:11Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-03-22T06:25:11Z",
    "body": "> Definition of the element can go in section 4.12 Scripting, since the slot element requires scripting to work, at least at this point. Maybe later with declarative shadow trees it can move to a shadow tree section or some such.\n\nMinor point: We can have `<slot>` without attachShadow. `<slot>` can live in a node tree which is not a shadow tree. Though it does not make much sense in practical, it can happen.\n",
